WEBVTT

00:01:59.426 --> 00:02:00.578
relationships,

00:02:00.578 --> 00:02:01.909
financial security,

00:02:01.909 --> 00:02:05.297
and personal safety.

00:02:05.297 --> 00:02:08.407
So what causes bipolar disorder?

00:02:08.407 --> 00:02:12.558
Researchers think a key player is 
the brain's intricate wiring.

00:02:12.558 --> 00:02:15.949
Healthy brains maintain strong connections
between neurons

00:02:15.949 --> 00:02:19.488
thanks to the brain's continuous efforts
to prune itself

00:02:19.488 --> 00:02:24.682
and remove unused or faulty
neural connections.

00:02:24.682 --> 00:02:28.977
This process is important because our 
neural pathways serve as a map

00:02:28.977 --> 00:02:31.389
for everything we do.